# Bosses: Koopalings, Boom Boom, Bowser Jr. and Bowser
#
# Addresses are RVAs (VA - 0x60000000). New Super Mario Bros. U Deluxe (Switch) v1.0.0 only.
# Each group's tag says where its names are declared: [codedx] in the codedx headers
# under include/, otherwise the header(s) holding the generated declarations. Names
# tagged [framework/mods] on an entry are the ones a framework part or mod needs.
# Constructors and destructors carry their C1/C2/D0/D1/D2 variant.

